==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|frm|harassement}}; synchronically analyzable as {{af|en|harass|-ment}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/həˈɹæsmənt/|/ˈhæɹəsmənt/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Persistent attacks and criticism causing [[worry]] and [[distress]].
# Deliberate [[pestering]] or [[annoying]].
# Excessive [[intimidation]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|torment}}
* {{l|en|molestation}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|verbal harassment}}
* {{l|en|workplace harassment}}
* {{l|en|sexual harassment}}

